Yes, the lateral thinking stuff is almost entirely directed toward creative
thinking.  I think that "there seems to be a lot of work going on" in
creativity research because there's a big market of really stupid people
willing to throw millions of dollars around to increase creativity.  Namely,
this is American management, seeking to foster innovation.  (Don't get me
